{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2021-08-18 08:05:00', 'title': 'AZZUR GROUP AND MODERNA EXPAND THEIR ONGOING RELATIONSHIP', 'text': 'BURLINGTON, MASS., AUG. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AZZUR CLEANROOMS ON DEMAND™ ("COD"), AN AZZUR GROUP COMPANY, MARKET-LEADING PROVIDERS FOR EARLY-PHASE\xa0LIFE SCIENCES\xa0GXP MANUFACTURING, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY ARE EXPANDING THEIR ONGOING BUSINESS RELATIONSHIP WITH THE LIFE SCIENCES COMPANY MODERNA TX, INC. ("MODERNA").'}